type UnpluginFactoryWithOptions = (userArgs: ParaglidePluginOptions, meta?: Parameters<UnpluginFactory<ParaglidePluginOptions>>[1], defaults?: UnpluginIntegrationOptions) => ReturnType<UnpluginFactory<ParaglidePluginOptions>>;
